{"channelId":"UCoy0db-BteKf56n0mPIb6KQ","row":["Brandon Raynor Naturopath",6190,"Welcome to the official channel of Brandon Raynor, internationally renowned Naturopath, massage therapist, and founder of Raynor Massage. For more than 25 years I have been teaching massage training, naturopathy, herbal medicine, nutrition, and holistic healing to students around the world.\n\nThis channel shares my philosophy of natural medicine and preventative health, with a focus on practical skills for healing body, mind, and spirit. Here you’ll find videos on Raynor Massage techniques, natural therapies, detoxification, diet, herbal remedies, and the deeper connection between physical tension and emotional well-being.\n\nMy mission is to make natural healing accessible, effective, and transformative. Whether you are interested in learning massage, exploring naturopathic principles, or simply improving your health naturally, this channel is for you.\n\n🌿 Learn more at: https://www.raynormassage.com\n\n#Naturopathy #MassageTraining #NaturalHealing #RaynorMassage","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoy0db-BteKf56n0mPIb6KQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoy0db-BteKf56n0mPIb6KQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:23.495Z","channelId":"UCoy0db-BteKf56n0mPIb6KQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e0fdcec32d326f22690b2eed2ec5fd40f368044a10819bb221de01c1f7033430","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"9be9c1b9b4094003b9c2c281f0de0e3ea0e78ab396dbbce109256626a810d8e3"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoy0db-BteKf56n0mPIb6KQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":6190,"raw":"6.19K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoy0db-BteKf56n0mPIb6KQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:23.495Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage ther